  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development, Investment, and Facilitation Program for Argentine Nature Tourism: the Nature Route</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de desarrollo, inversin y facilitacin del turismo de naturaleza de Argentina: La ruta natural</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es incrementar el gasto turstico en reas naturales definidas como de inters, as como en sus destinos asociados.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program i to increase tourist spending in natural areas of tourist interest, as well as their associated destinations.</narrative>
  </description>
